            <div xml:id="d692">

                <pb facs="0804" n="692" xml:id="pg692"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.512/1431: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-10-14T21:00:00+08:00">October 14, 1935—9
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 14—10:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>58. Embassy’s 55, October 14 noon. U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Asheville</hi> at Canton has been ordered to proceed immediately to Swatow
                    and should arrive at Swatow tomorrow morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
